   Cheung, Teris; Yeung, Wing-Fai, Hong Kong Polytech Univ, Sch Nursing, Hong Kong, Peoples R China.
   Lam, Simon Ching, Tung Wah Coll, Sch Nursing, Hong Kong, Peoples R China.
   Chung, Ka-Fai, Univ Hong Kong, Li Ka Shing Fac Med, Dept Psychiat, Hong Kong, Peoples R China.
   Ho, Fiona Yan-Yee, Chinese Univ Hong Kong, Dept Psychol, Hong Kong, Peoples R China.},
